    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765070/extras/ad73ac7bc2a7c3359dfe2559ec750f4f.avif?t=1745941962\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>STORY </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an Earth ravaged by a nuclear conflict, humanity struggles to rebuild in the year 333 A.C. Emerging from the aftermath, the &quot;Free World Alliance&quot; (FWA) imposes order while suppressing dissenting factions seeking independence. Amidst rising tensions, the &quot;Iron Dawn&quot; rebels harness repurposed Mobile Frames as deadly Mechs, challenging the FWA's dominance. <br>As skirmishes escalate in 332 A.C., the Iron Dawn gains traction, prompting the FWA to counter with their own Mechs. With support swelling for the Iron Dawn, their sights are set on overthrowing the FWA and invading Valeria. In the throes of full-scale warfare in 333 A.C., you step into the role of a captain within the &quot;Ghost Squad,&quot; the 7th Mech division of the Iron Dawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As part of the Ghost Squad, your mission is pivotal: infiltrate enemy territory, sow chaos, and weaken defenses. Your strategic actions hold the key to the success of the division's assault against the FWA. Join the Iron Dawn, lead your squad in disrupting enemy forces, and become the linchpin in a crucial assault that will determine the fate of a war-torn world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > LEAD THE SQUAD TO VICTORY </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead the Ghost Squad in piloting over 25 Mechs, each equipped with diverse arsenals inspired by the Iron Dawn's struggle. Engage in varied missions, leveraging these powerful machines to pave the path to victory against the oppressive forces of the Free World Alliance.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765070/extras/6918e06027703cbeef4f9890a2f6b2df.poster.avif?t=1745941962\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765070/extras/6918e06027703cbeef4f9890a2f6b2df.webm?t=1745941962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765070/extras/6918e06027703cbeef4f9890a2f6b2df.mp4?t=1745941962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ENVIRONMENTAL HAVOC UNLEASHED </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with a fully destructible environment, tactically leveraging it to gain an edge. Witness the spectacle as crumbling surroundings accentuate the might of your Mechs, intensifying the thrill and empowerment of each encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765070/extras/a5d97abfe3c0c591dd301a0494af6508.poster.avif?t=1745941962\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765070/extras/a5d97abfe3c0c591dd301a0494af6508.webm?t=1745941962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765070/extras/a5d97abfe3c0c591dd301a0494af6508.mp4?t=1745941962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 25 Mechs, 40 weapons, and 20 pilots with different behavior.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100% destructible environment.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mission base</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765070/extras/6f07b15e8aeeca7f5556bebb1c3d8947.poster.avif?t=1745941962\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765070/extras/6f07b15e8aeeca7f5556bebb1c3d8947.webm?t=1745941962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765070/extras/6f07b15e8aeeca7f5556bebb1c3d8947.mp4?t=1745941962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765070/extras/ad73ac7bc2a7c3359dfe2559ec750f4f.avif?t=1745941962\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>STORY </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an Earth ravaged by a nuclear conflict, humanity struggles to rebuild in the year 333 A.C. Emerging from the aftermath, the &quot;Free World Alliance&quot; (FWA) imposes order while suppressing dissenting factions seeking independence. Amidst rising tensions, the &quot;Iron Dawn&quot; rebels harness repurposed Mobile Frames as deadly Mechs, challenging the FWA's dominance. <br>As skirmishes escalate in 332 A.C., the Iron Dawn gains traction, prompting the FWA to counter with their own Mechs. With support swelling for the Iron Dawn, their sights are set on overthrowing the FWA and invading Valeria. In the throes of full-scale warfare in 333 A.C., you step into the role of a captain within the &quot;Ghost Squad,&quot; the 7th Mech division of the Iron Dawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As part of the Ghost Squad, your mission is pivotal: infiltrate enemy territory, sow chaos, and weaken defenses. Your strategic actions hold the key to the success of the division's assault against the FWA. Join the Iron Dawn, lead your squad in disrupting enemy forces, and become the linchpin in a crucial assault that will determine the fate of a war-torn world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > LEAD THE SQUAD TO VICTORY </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead the Ghost Squad in piloting over 25 Mechs, each equipped with diverse arsenals inspired by the Iron Dawn's struggle. Engage in varied missions, leveraging these powerful machines to pave the path to victory against the oppressive forces of the Free World Alliance.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765070/extras/6918e06027703cbeef4f9890a2f6b2df.poster.avif?t=1745941962\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765070/extras/6918e06027703cbeef4f9890a2f6b2df.webm?t=1745941962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765070/extras/6918e06027703cbeef4f9890a2f6b2df.mp4?t=1745941962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ENVIRONMENTAL HAVOC UNLEASHED </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with a fully destructible environment, tactically leveraging it to gain an edge. Witness the spectacle as crumbling surroundings accentuate the might of your Mechs, intensifying the thrill and empowerment of each encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765070/extras/a5d97abfe3c0c591dd301a0494af6508.poster.avif?t=1745941962\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765070/extras/a5d97abfe3c0c591dd301a0494af6508.webm?t=1745941962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765070/extras/a5d97abfe3c0c591dd301a0494af6508.mp4?t=1745941962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 25 Mechs, 40 weapons, and 20 pilots with different behavior.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100% destructible environment.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mission base</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765070/extras/6f07b15e8aeeca7f5556bebb1c3d8947.poster.avif?t=1745941962\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765070/extras/6f07b15e8aeeca7f5556bebb1c3d8947.webm?t=1745941962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765070/extras/6f07b15e8aeeca7f5556bebb1c3d8947.mp4?t=1745941962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
